00:06:43.896 --> 00:06:45.400
(dishes clanging)

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:49.743
Wow, the rice is fluffy,
it's cooked through.

00:06:49.743 --> 00:06:52.820
All right, so the last
step is to just add some

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.480
Parmesan and Parmesan is super salty,

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:59.410
so this will really add a
ton of flavor to your dish.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:01.440
I'm gonna go a little simple
here with the garnish,

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.490
just a little bit of cracked black pepper,

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:04.970
'cause I think it really pairs well

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:07.710
with the creaminess of the Parmesan.

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:08.620
And that's it.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.850
Let's go see if she likes it.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.093
All right, dinner time!

00:07:11.093 --> 00:07:12.215
- Dinner time!

00:07:12.215 --> 00:07:13.941
- I think this is gonna be your favorite.

00:07:13.941 --> 00:07:16.730
Looks good.
- Oh my God, I love risotto.

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:18.360
I can't believe you even
made risotto in a microwave.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.426
- I know.

00:07:19.426 --> 00:07:20.980
(upbeat music)

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:22.463
(Jasmine moans)
Told you.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.640
- Moment of silence.
(Kelly laughs)

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.990
You are unreal.
(Kelly laughs)

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.970
The mushroom is so rich.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.930
The rice is cooked to perfection.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:34.763
- Yay or nay?
- Yay!

00:07:34.763 --> 00:07:36.653
- Three yays!
- [Jasmine] Yay, baby!

00:07:36.653 --> 00:07:37.530
(Kelly laughs)

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.680
That is three yays, it's time for dessert.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:40.530
- Okay!
- Okay?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.050
Last up is dessert.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:44.356
I know it is Jasmine's
favorite meal of the day,

00:07:44.356 --> 00:07:47.360
so I'm making a Snickerdoodle mug cake.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.210
So we're gonna start with some flour,

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.653
brown sugar, salt, baking powder.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.610
Just gonna stir this.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:59.410
