00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:17.233
Is it worth my time?

00:08:17.233 --> 00:08:18.260
I don't know, we'll see.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.225
So I'm just gonna pour
a little bit in here.

00:08:20.225 --> 00:08:21.585
(mug clanging)

00:08:21.585 --> 00:08:24.785
Add a sprinkle of cinnamon sugar.

00:08:24.785 --> 00:08:29.380
All right, so more batter,
more sugar, batter.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:31.690
We'll do a little bit more sugar.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.060
All right, I'm gonna pop
this in the microwave

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.225
for a minute and a half.

00:08:34.225 --> 00:08:35.058
(microwave beeping)

00:08:35.058 --> 00:08:38.010
It smells like cinnamon
sugar heaven in here,

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.612
like oh my God.

00:08:39.612 --> 00:08:42.090
And just to really make
it special for Jasmine,

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.880
I'm gonna add some vanilla ice cream.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:47.030
All right, we're gonna
add some caramel drizzle

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:49.600
and dark chocolate chips.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:51.198
Let's get her in and have some dessert.

00:08:51.198 --> 00:08:52.865
Dessert!
- Thank you!

00:08:53.712 --> 00:08:56.210
(upbeat music)
(Jasmine moans)

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.330
This is beautiful.

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.080
I just can't believe
everything you made today

00:08:59.080 --> 00:08:59.940
is from a microwave.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.010
- So I did well?
- Well?

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.000
You did perfect, yay!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.360
- How many Jasmine stars
do you give Chef Mike?

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.690
- Four.
- Four, whoo!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.320
- One star for every mug meal.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.370
- You can make gourmet
meals in the microwave.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:13.203
- You really can.

00:09:13.203 --> 00:09:14.230
- Thank you guys for watching.

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:16.225
Let us know in the comments
which one was your favorite.

00:09:16.225 --> 00:09:18.070
Bye!
- All of them.

